| **Vite** | Build tool |
| **TailwindCSS** | Styling |
| **Recharts** | Charts & graphs |
| **Framer Motion** | Animations |
| **React Router** | Routing |
| **Axios** | HTTP client |
| **Lucide React** | Icons |
| **React Three Fiber** | 3D Earth (optional) |

